an><span class="rf-text">War breaks out between the Germanic alliances led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arminius">Arminius</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maroboduus">Maroboduus</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">19</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/catualda">Catualda</a> deposes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maroboduus">Maroboduus</a>, who goes into exile among the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roman-empire">Romans</a> at Ravenna</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">167 or 169</span><span class="rf-text">The Marcomanni and Quadi cross the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/danube">Danube</a>, destroy Opitergium and besiege <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aquileia">Aquileia</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">179</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roman-empire">Romans</a> win a decisive battle at Laugaricio, and by 180 the Marcomanni and Quadi are under occupation</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">395</span><span class="rf-text">The Marcomanni join <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/huns">Huns</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/goths">Goths</a>, Alans and others in a great raid across the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/danube">Danube</a> into the Roman <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/balkans">Balkans</a></span></li></ol>
